<font color="#ffff00"><i>RELOADING</i></font>

1318
01:44:59,105 --> 01:45:00,775
<font color="#ffff00">No!</font>

1319
01:45:23,165 --> 01:45:24,941
<font color="#ffff00">Arty, we have got this.
You need to log out!</font>

1320
01:45:24,965 --> 01:45:27,635
<font color="#ffff00">If the game is <i>Adventure</i>
, why haven't they won yet?</font>

1321
01:45:27,715 --> 01:45:29,965
<font color="#ffff00">I don't know.
Arty, I'm serious.</font>

1322
01:45:29,975 --> 01:45:31,975
<font color="#ffff00">Sorrento is crazy.
He will kill you.</font>

1323
01:45:33,695 --> 01:45:35,135
<font color="#ffff00"><i>What are you looking at?</i></font>

1324
01:45:35,745 --> 01:45:37,275
<font color="#ffff00">There is nothing over there.</font>

1325
01:45:38,595 --> 01:45:40,105
<font color="#ffff00">You are in trouble aren't you?</font>

1326
01:45:42,915 --> 01:45:44,275
<font color="#ffff00">Samantha...</font>

1327
01:45:45,345 --> 01:45:47,801
<font color="#ffff00">- You know I love you.
- Not the time, Z.</font>

1328
01:45:47,825 --> 01:45:49,125
<font color="#ffff00">I can handle the challenge...</font>

1329
01:45:49,135 --> 01:45:51,575
<font color="#ffff00">but I can't let you get
hurt in the real world.</font>

1330
01:45:52,465 --> 01:45:55,705
<font color="#ffff00">Get out of IOI and
meet us at River South.</font>

1331
01:46:01,865 --> 01:46:03,541
<font color="#ffff00">Wade, no.</font>

1332
01:46:03,565 --> 01:46:05,441
<font color="#ffff00">You will forgive me for this, I promise.</font>

1333
01:46:05,465 --> 01:46:07,275
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, no, no no!</font>

1334
01:46:08,815 --> 01:46:10,305
<font color="#ffff00">END OF THE GAME</font>

1335
01:46:16,925 --> 01:46:19,975
<font color="#ffff00">Get up, Sixer.
Back to the beginning.</font>

1336
01:46:20,205 --> 01:46:22,635
<font color="#ffff00">Let's go, move!
You are in.</font>

1337
01:46:41,065 --> 01:46:43,591
<font color="#ffff00">Holy hand grenade!
How much did that cost?</font>

1338
01:46:43,615 --> 01:46:46,475
<font color="#ffff00">Less than it's gonna cost them.</font>

1339
01:46:47,460 --> 01:46:48,770
<font color="#ffff00">What is that?</font>

1340
01:46:59,360 --> 01:47:02,000
<font color="#ffff00">Sir, the gunters are
approaching the challenge.</font>

1341
01:47:02,160 --> 01:47:04,120
<font color="#ffff00">- I-R0k?
- In position, sir.</font>

1342
01:47:04,130 --> 01:47:05,366
<font color="#ffff00">Prepare my rig.</font>

1343
01:47:05,390 --> 01:47:06,770
<font color="#ffff00">The ice is holding.</font>

1344
01:47:07,060 --> 01:47:08,500
<font color="#ffff00">Still going.</font>

1345
01:47:18,360 --> 01:47:19,670
<font color="#ffff00">Wait.</font>

1346
01:47:19,800 --> 01:47:21,200
<font color="#ffff00">He's trying to win.</font>

1347
01:47:24,290 --> 01:47:25,600
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah!</font>

1348
01:47:25,890 --> 01:47:27,300
<font color="#ffff00">I won!</font>

1349
01:47:30,260 --> 01:47:31,700
<font color="#ffff00">He lost.</font>

1350
01:47:32,210 --> 01:47:33,710
<font color="#ffff00">Not <i>Adventure </i>.</font>

1351
01:47:38,360 --> 01:47:40,470
<font color="#ffff00">Everyone who wins...</font>

1352
01:47:41,370 --> 01:47:42,676
<font color="#ffff00">loses.</font>

1353
01:47:42,700 --> 01:47:44,270
<font color="#ffff00">It's not about winning...</font>

1354
01:47:44,860 --> 01:47:46,330
<font color="#ffff00">it's about playing.</font>

1355
01:47:47,090 --> 01:47:49,060
<font color="#ffff00">Remember Halliday's announcement.</font>

1356
01:47:49,690 --> 01:47:51,016
<font color="#ffff00">The keys are invisible...</font>

1357
01:47:51,040 --> 01:47:53,930
<font color="#ffff00">And they are hidden in a dark room, it's at
the center of a maze.</font>

1358
01:47:54,760 --> 01:47:57,940
<font color="#ffff00">Well, there is a secret in <i>Adventure</i>
you don't find it by winning.</font>

1359
01:47:58,490 --> 01:48:00,970
<font color="#ffff00">You find it by wandering
around in a dark room.</font>

1360
01:48:01,380 --> 01:48:03,116
<font color="#ffff00">Until you get to the invisible dot.</font>

1361
01:48:03,140 --> 01:48:05,036
<font color="#ffff00">Pretty easy if you know what you're doing.</font>

1362
01:48:05,060 --> 01:48:06,370
<font color="#ffff00">Really?</font>

1363
01:48:06,860 --> 01:48:08,750
<font color="#ffff00">Let me finish it for you.</font>

1364
01:48:13,220 --> 01:48:16,500
<font color="#ffff00">Your last chance, Wade.
Last chance.</font>

1365
01:48:16,760 --> 01:48:17,790
<font color="#ffff00">Give me the key.</font>

1366
01:48:17,800 --> 01:48:22,170
<font color="#ffff00">I give you 50 million in
your account right now.</font>

1367
01:48:23,060 --> 01:48:25,260
<font color="#ffff00">Why the hell would I ever do that?</font>

1368
01:48:26,810 --> 01:48:28,466
<font color="#ffff00">Dude that's the <i>Cataclist</i>!</font>

1369
01:48:28,490 --> 01:48:29,986
<font color="#ffff00">Now, personally I wouldn't care.</font>

1370
01:48:30,010 --> 01:48:32,320
<font color="#ffff00">I just assume you'd never set
foot in the OASIS again...</font>

1371
01:48:32,330 --> 01:48:34,390
<font color="#ffff00">no longer have to deal with
any of this absurdity...</font>

1372
01:48:34,400 --> 01:48:38,430
<font color="#ffff00">but I know how important
Halliday's competition is to you.</font>

1373
01:48:39,590 --> 01:48:41,900
<font color="#ffff00">I will never let the
future of the OASIS...</font>

1374
01:48:41,920 --> 01:48:44,026
<font color="#ffff00">rest in your hands,
Nolan Sorrento.</font>

1375
01:48:44,050 --> 01:48:46,770
<font color="#ffff00">Well that's fine.
Three easy steps.</font>

1376
01:48:47,170 --> 01:48:47,820
<font color="#ffff00">One.</font>

1377
01:48:47,830 --> 01:48:49,420
<font color="#ffff00">Wait, I thought that you were bluffing.</font>

1378
01:48:49,430 --> 01:48:50,759
<font color="#ffff00">Do you know that kills all of us.</font>

1379
01:48:50,760 --> 01:48:52,526
<font color="#ffff00">I have got 10 years worth
of this shit inside of me.</font>

1380
01:48:52,550 --> 01:48:55,630
<font color="#ffff00">- Last chance. Two.
- I will not go out like that.</font>

1381
01:48:55,710 --> 01:48:58,830
<font color="#ffff00">Like that's a camper move.
You don't even know how to activate an orb.</font>

1382
01:49:10,360 --> 01:49:12,070
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I felt those.</font>

1383
01:49:12,960 --> 01:49:14,820
<font color="#ffff00">But this is my world, Sorrento.</font>

1384
01:49:18,910 --> 01:49:20,870
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Hadoken</i>!</font>

1385
01:49:40,160 --> 01:49:42,500
<font color="#ffff00">- No no no!
- Step three.</font>

1386
01:49:42,510 --> 01:49:44,130
<font color="#ffff00">No no no!</font>

1387
01:50:41,580 --> 01:50:43,400
<font color="#ffff00">Get me out of this thing.</font>

1388
01:50:59,090 --> 01:51:00,400
<font color="#ffff00">Guys?</font>

1389
01:51:06,960 --> 01:51:08,910
<font color="#ffff00">Z! He's still alive!</font>

1390
01:51:13,990 --> 01:51:15,870
<font color="#ffff00">EXTRA LIFE</font>

1391
01:51:16,620 --> 01:51:18,100
<font color="#ffff00">Extra life?</font>

1392
01:51:21,190 --> 01:51:22,770
<font color="#ffff00">Thanks, Curator.</font>

1393
01:51:25,020 --> 01:51:26,560
<font color="#ffff00">Hold on!</font>

1394
01:51:28,360 --> 01:51:30,070
<font color="#ffff00">BOARD 1-PARZIVAL.</font>

1395
01:51:31,560 --> 01:51:33,910
<font color="#ffff00"><i>INCOMING LIVE STREAM
PARZIVAL PLAYS FOR CRYSTAL KEY</i></font>

1396
01:51:34,120 --> 01:51:36,370
<font color="#ffff00">Why feed in all OASIS channels?</font>

1397
01:51:36,890 --> 01:51:39,440
<font color="#ffff00">Halliday wanted everyone to
watch the end of the contest.</font>

1398
01:51:39,498 --> 01:51:41,358
<font color="#ffff00">That's so Halliday!</font>

1399
01:51:41,618 --> 01:51:44,804
<font color="#ffff00">- We tried <i>Adventure</i>.
- No, we try to win it.</font>

1400
01:51:44,828 --> 01:51:47,178
<font color="#ffff00">But the hidden room is not
at the end of the game.</font>

1401
01:51:47,308 --> 01:51:50,138
<font color="#ffff00">You gotta go straight to the
invisible dot at the start.</font>

1402
01:51:53,338 --> 01:51:55,648
<font color="#ffff00">ENLIST TODAY</font>

1403
01:52:03,518 --> 01:52:04,694
<font color="#ffff00">Is that her?</font>

1404
01:52:04,718 --> 01:52:08,648
<font color="#ffff00">Red hair, IOI uniform, doesn't
know a planet she's on.</font>

1405
01:52:09,008 --> 01:52:10,318
<font color="#ffff00">That's her.</font>

1406
01:52:21,748 --> 01:52:24,398
<font color="#ffff00">I'm Toshiro.
You know me as Daito.</font>

1407
01:52:31,068 --> 01:52:32,378
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, Arty.</font>

1408
01:52:34,648 --> 01:52:36,428
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah I know.</font>

1409
01:52:36,818 --> 01:52:38,388
<font color="#ffff00">Not what you were expecting huh.</font>

1410
01:52:38,398 --> 01:52:41,328
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I wasn't expecting a...</font>

1411
01:52:41,608 --> 01:52:43,888
<font color="#ffff00">Late 30s model postal van.</font>

1412
01:52:46,128 --> 01:52:47,438
<font color="#ffff00">Wade?</font>

1413
01:52:47,628 --> 01:52:49,684
<font color="#ffff00">If the Cataclist went off,
how come you still playing?</font>

1414
01:52:49,708 --> 01:52:52,528
<font color="#ffff00">Extra life, long history.
Sorry I shot you.</font>

1415
01:52:54,968 --> 01:52:57,198
<font color="#ffff00">- Sho?
- What?</font>

1416
01:52:57,199 --> 01:52:58,778
<font color="#ffff00">Do I have to wear a sign saying</font>

1417
01:52:58,788 --> 01:53:01,398
<font color="#ffff00">"I'm 11 years old, shoot me first"?</font>

1418
01:53:01,408 --> 01:53:02,498
<font color="#ffff00">No thanks.</font>

1419
01:53:02,518 --> 01:53:04,584
<font color="#ffff00">- Give me a hug!
- The ninjas don't hug!</font>

1420
01:53:04,608 --> 01:53:06,638
<font color="#ffff00">Alright everybody. Hold on to something!</font>

1421
01:53:27,798 --> 01:53:29,438
<font color="#ffff00">Got you.</font>

1422
01:53:32,868 --> 01:53:34,708
<font color="#ffff00">Come on, Nolan. Pick up.</font>

1423
01:53:36,798 --> 01:53:39,148
<font color="#ffff00">F'Nale, tell me something good.</font>

1424
01:53:39,828 --> 01:53:42,204
<font color="#ffff00">I have got a drone on their tail.
I'm close.</font>

1425
01:53:42,228 --> 01:53:45,378
<font color="#ffff00">- Send me coordinates.
- Maybe you should leave this to me, Nolan.</font>

1426
01:53:47,358 --> 01:53:48,668
<font color="#ffff00">Nolan?</font>

1427
01:53:49,228 --> 01:53:50,538
<font color="#ffff00">Nolan!</font>

1428
01:53:51,193 --> 01:53:52,390
<font color="#ffff00">Out!</font>

1429
01:54:01,115 --> 01:54:02,556
<font color="#ffff00">Give me that.</font>

1430
01:54:07,368 --> 01:54:09,038
<font color="#ffff00">What's going on out there?</font>

1431
01:54:13,618 --> 01:54:16,278
<font color="#ffff00">The game is over for them,
what are they watching?</font>

1432
01:54:18,468 --> 01:54:20,948
<font color="#ffff00">The final key.
It's being broadcast.</font>

1433
01:54:22,818 --> 01:54:26,598
<font color="#ffff00"><i>You see, Warren Robinett
was proud of Adventure.</i></font>

1434
01:54:27,108 --> 01:54:29,368
<font color="#ffff00"><i>He wanted people to
know who was behind it.</i></font>

1435
01:54:30,256 --> 01:54:32,886
<font color="#ffff00">That is why he created the
first digital "<i> Easter egg</i> ".</font>

1436
01:54:33,056 --> 01:54:35,656
<font color="#ffff00">And to find it you did
not even have to win.</font>

1437
01:54:35,756 --> 01:54:39,612
<font color="#ffff00">You just had to play searching around...</font>

1438
01:54:39,636 --> 01:54:43,166
<font color="#ffff00">in rooms for an invisible dot.</font>

1439
01:54:44,216 --> 01:54:46,616
<font color="#ffff00">You took the dot back to
the main screen and...</font>

1440
01:54:46,796 --> 01:54:50,405
<font color="#ffff00">that's when you found the 1st
<i>Easter egg</i> ever put in a video game.</font>

1441
01:54:50,406 --> 01:54:52,642
<font color="#ffff00">The creator's name.</font>

1442
01:54:52,666 --> 01:54:54,226
<font color="#ffff00">CREATED BY WARREN ROBINETT</font>

1443
01:55:16,956 --> 01:55:19,052
<font color="#ffff00">What's going on?
Man, I can't see shit.</font>

1444
01:55:19,076 --> 01:55:21,076
<font color="#ffff00">Parzival just got the Crystal key!</font>

1445
01:55:35,996 --> 01:55:38,186
<font color="#ffff00">Do you want it or not?</font>

1446
01:55:41,066 --> 01:55:42,966
<font color="#ffff00">Hache, what the hell is going on?</font>

1447
01:55:42,976 --> 01:55:45,096
<font color="#ffff00">Just practicing my Mario Cart.
What do you think?</font>

1448
01:55:45,106 --> 01:55:47,106
<font color="#ffff00">IOI trying to kill us man!</font>

1449
01:56:01,406 --> 01:56:03,666
<font color="#ffff00">Everyone watching: if you're
in the Columbus Sacks...</font>

1450
01:56:03,676 --> 01:56:06,742
<font color="#ffff00">This is Perzival.
My real world name is Wade Watts...</font>

1451
01:56:06,766 --> 01:56:07,842
<font color="#ffff00">and we are gonna need your help.</font>

1452
01:56:07,866 --> 01:56:10,966
<font color="#ffff00">- Hache, head for the stacks.
- Okay, hold on!</font>

1453
01:56:36,766 --> 01:56:38,806
<font color="#ffff00">Stick the key in!
How hard is it?</font>

1454
01:56:44,026 --> 01:56:45,336
<font color="#ffff00">Come on.</font>

1455
01:57:10,926 --> 01:57:12,326
<font color="#ffff00">That's it?</font>

1456
01:57:12,916 --> 01:57:19,122
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah that's it, now you just sign
these papers and the OASIS is yours.</font>

1457
01:57:19,146 --> 01:57:25,486
<font color="#ffff00">You will be it's sole proprietor.
That isn't too bad, is it?</font>

1458
01:57:46,966 --> 01:57:48,606
<font color="#ffff00">I am gonna need a second.</font>

1459
01:58:16,566 --> 01:58:17,936
<font color="#ffff00"><i>This is wrong.</i></font>

1460
01:58:19,176 --> 01:58:21,986
<font color="#ffff00">This pen, this contract.</font>

1461
01:58:25,186 --> 01:58:28,656
<font color="#ffff00">This is the moment that Halliday made
Morrow sign over his shares in Gragarous.</font>

1462
01:58:29,826 --> 01:58:32,026
<font color="#ffff00">That was the biggest mistake of his life.</font>

1463
01:58:32,466 --> 01:58:33,896
<font color="#ffff00">He knew that.</font>

1464
01:58:36,276 --> 01:58:38,046
<font color="#ffff00">This can't be the end.</font>

1465
01:58:39,616 --> 01:58:41,136
<font color="#ffff00">It's a test.</font>

1466
01:58:45,886 --> 01:58:48,176
<font color="#ffff00">I won't make the same mistake that you did.</font>

1467
01:58:58,986 --> 01:59:02,576
<font color="#ffff00">I just needed to be sure.</font>

1468
01:59:16,096 --> 01:59:17,876
<font color="#ffff00">This is where you grew up.</font>

1469
01:59:27,526 --> 01:59:30,376
<font color="#ffff00">Oh that's just me a long time ago.</font>

1470
01:59:30,766 --> 01:59:33,586
<font color="#ffff00">I like to have him around
from time to time.</font>

1471
01:59:34,196 --> 01:59:36,633
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, I have to show you something, this...</font>

1472
01:59:36,634 --> 01:59:40,358
<font color="#ffff00">This is the button.</font>

1473
01:59:40,382 --> 01:59:43,602
<font color="#ffff00">If you push it, the whole
simulation shuts down...</font>

1474
01:59:43,612 --> 01:59:47,272
<font color="#ffff00">and a tapeworm program will erase
all of the back up servers.</font>

1475
01:59:47,282 --> 01:59:51,182
<font color="#ffff00">So you now have the power to turn the
OASIS off forever.</font>

1476
01:59:51,302 --> 01:59:52,892
<font color="#ffff00">You understand?</font>

1477
01:59:58,442 --> 02:00:03,672
<font color="#ffff00">Try not to accidentally erase the
whole of the OASIS on your first day.</font>

1478
02:00:13,502 --> 02:00:15,642
<font color="#ffff00">The stacks are straight ahead.</font>

1479
02:00:30,642 --> 02:00:33,862
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I expect you have to go, I know I do.</font>

1480
02:00:33,902 --> 02:00:38,592
<font color="#ffff00">So now is the time for you to receive
your prize because you won all 3 keys.</font>

1481
02:00:38,862 --> 02:00:43,052
<font color="#ffff00">Once you take this egg, the
game will be over.</font>

1482
02:00:43,642 --> 02:00:45,222
<font color="#ffff00">The egg...</font>

1483
02:00:45,992 --> 02:00:47,822
<font color="#ffff00">The egg?</font>

1484
02:00:54,142 --> 02:00:56,242
<font color="#ffff00">We know what you did here.</font>

1485
02:00:56,402 --> 02:00:59,512
<font color="#ffff00">You turn around and walk out
of here while you still can.</font>

1486
02:01:12,832 --> 02:01:18,342
<font color="#ffff00">I created the OASIS because I never
felt at home in the real world.</font>

1487
02:01:20,022 --> 02:01:23,332
<font color="#ffff00">I just didn't know how to
connect with people there.</font>

1488
02:01:24,692 --> 02:01:27,382
<font color="#ffff00">I was afraid for all my life.</font>

1489
02:01:27,652 --> 02:01:30,812
<font color="#ffff00">Right up until the day I
knew my life was ending.</font>

1490
02:01:36,142 --> 02:01:37,168
<font color="#ffff00">And that...</font>

1491
02:01:37,192 --> 02:01:40,052
<font color="#ffff00">That was when I realized that...</font>

1492
02:01:40,902 --> 02:01:46,512
<font color="#ffff00">as terrifying and
painful as reality can be...</font>

1493
02:01:47,042 --> 02:01:48,552
<font color="#ffff00">it's also...</font>

1494
02:01:49,142 --> 02:01:51,412
<font color="#ffff00">the only place...</font>

1495
02:01:52,792 --> 02:01:55,052
<font color="#ffff00">where you get a descent meal.</font>

1496
02:02:00,962 --> 02:02:02,402
<font color="#ffff00">Because...</font>

1497
02:02:04,022 --> 02:02:05,912
<font color="#ffff00">Reality...</font>

1498
02:02:10,902 --> 02:02:12,552
<font color="#ffff00">is real.</font>

1499
02:02:12,802 --> 02:02:14,742
<font color="#ffff00">You understand what I'm saying?</font>

1500
02:02:16,272 --> 02:02:18,712
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. Yes I do.</font>

1501
02:02:28,702 --> 02:02:30,312
<font color="#ffff00">He did it.</font>

1502
02:02:31,702 --> 02:02:33,342
<font color="#ffff00">He got the egg.</font>

1503
02:02:33,652 --> 02:02:35,112
<font color="#ffff00">Hurrah!</font>

1504
02:02:36,402 --> 02:02:38,472
<font color="#ffff00">No! Please!</font>

1505
02:03:11,362 --> 02:03:12,672
<font color="#ffff00">Hold it!</font>

1506
02:03:14,742 --> 02:03:18,252
<font color="#ffff00">Drop the gun!
Now! On the ground!</font>

1507
02:03:18,372 --> 02:03:20,982
<font color="#ffff00">Turn around. Hands in your head!</font>

1508
02:03:21,242 --> 02:03:23,052
<font color="#ffff00">Walk back towards me!</font>

1509
02:03:27,652 --> 02:03:29,712
<font color="#ffff00">GAME OVER</font>

1510
02:03:38,512 --> 02:03:39,952
<font color="#ffff00">Mr. Halliday...</font>

1511
02:03:41,242 --> 02:03:43,252
<font color="#ffff00">Something I don't understand...</font>

1512
02:03:44,012 --> 02:03:46,392
<font color="#ffff00">You're not an avatar, are you?</font>

1513
02:03:47,142 --> 02:03:48,452
<font color="#ffff00">No.</font>

1514
02:03:50,342 --> 02:03:52,332
<font color="#ffff00">Is Halliday really dead?</font>

1515
02:03:53,872 --> 02:03:55,382
<font color="#ffff00">Yes.</font>

1516
02:04:01,342 --> 02:04:02,912
<font color="#ffff00">Then what are you?</font>

1517
02:04:06,172 --> 02:04:08,252
<font color="#ffff00">Goodbye, Parzival.</font>

1518
02:04:09,842 --> 02:04:11,152
<font color="#ffff00">Thanks.</font>

1519
02:04:12,472 --> 02:04:14,732
<font color="#ffff00">Thanks for playing my game.</font>

1520
02:04:43,842 --> 02:04:45,212
<font color="#ffff00">Wade?</font>

1521
02:04:46,662 --> 02:04:48,418
<font color="#ffff00">Ogden Morrow?!</font>

1522
02:04:48,442 --> 02:04:49,572
<font color="#ffff00">You can call me Og.</font>

1523
02:04:49,582 --> 02:04:53,082
<font color="#ffff00">Now, there are some people out here
that would very much like to meet you.</font>

1524
02:04:53,602 --> 02:04:56,392
<font color="#ffff00">Wow! This is incredible.</font>

1525
02:04:56,602 --> 02:04:58,782
<font color="#ffff00">It's an honor to meet you., Og.</font>

1526
02:05:03,662 --> 02:05:05,682
<font color="#ffff00">There's something I need to do first.</font>

1527
02:05:09,342 --> 02:05:11,112
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not like Halliday.</font>

1528
02:05:14,772 --> 02:05:16,572
<font color="#ffff00">I am taking the leap.</font>

1529
02:05:33,342 --> 02:05:35,112
<font color="#ffff00">We're looking for Wade Watts.</font>

1530
02:05:36,442 --> 02:05:38,142
<font color="#ffff00">We need you to make a statement</font>

1531
02:05:38,152 --> 02:05:40,743
<font color="#ffff00">about the clip you sent in of Nolan
Sorrento's confession.</font>

1532
02:05:41,542 --> 02:05:42,982
<font color="#ffff00">That was me.</font>

1533
02:05:43,772 --> 02:05:46,002
<font color="#ffff00">What? I record
everything in my workshop.</font>

1534
02:05:52,582 --> 02:05:54,312
<font color="#ffff00">Help me with this.</font>

1535
02:06:00,772 --> 02:06:02,252
<font color="#ffff00">Who are you guys?</font>

1536
02:06:03,022 --> 02:06:04,798
<font color="#ffff00">The people you need right now.</font>

1537
02:06:04,822 --> 02:06:07,652
<font color="#ffff00">Lawyers from Gregarious Games.</font>

1538
02:06:10,172 --> 02:06:12,302
<font color="#ffff00">They want your signature, Wade.</font>

1539
02:06:19,642 --> 02:06:21,782
<font color="#ffff00">I am splitting it with my clan.</font>

1540
02:06:22,102 --> 02:06:24,002
<font color="#ffff00">We are gonna run things together.</font>

1541
02:06:28,442 --> 02:06:30,122
<font color="#ffff00">That's a good choice.</font>

1542
02:06:58,272 --> 02:07:01,292
<font color="#ffff00">F'Nale, listen to me very carefully...</font>

1543
02:07:10,542 --> 02:07:12,912
<font color="#ffff00">Mr. Morrow, I mean, Og.</font>

1544
02:07:13,502 --> 02:07:14,918
<font color="#ffff00">How did you get here so fast?</font>

1545
02:07:14,942 --> 02:07:17,712
<font color="#ffff00">I flew from the stars
on my magic sleigh.</font>

1546
02:07:18,172 --> 02:07:19,892
<font color="#ffff00">Everyone's been watching.</font>

1547
02:07:20,462 --> 02:07:23,682
<font color="#ffff00">Of course I've been watching
it a little closer than most.</font>

1548
02:07:27,512 --> 02:07:28,822
<font color="#ffff00">You?</font>

1549
02:07:29,242 --> 02:07:30,952
<font color="#ffff00">You're the Curator?</font>

1550
02:07:34,302 --> 02:07:36,572
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Well played, Parzival.</i></font>

1551
02:07:37,792 --> 02:07:39,772
<font color="#ffff00">Jim told me nothing
about the contest...</font>

1552
02:07:39,782 --> 02:07:43,158
<font color="#ffff00">so there was no rule about me
losing a bet to a smart kid.</font>

1553
02:07:43,182 --> 02:07:45,382
<font color="#ffff00">Not that you needed my help.</font>

1554
02:07:46,002 --> 02:07:49,682
<font color="#ffff00">You figured out that
Kira was the key on your own.</font>

1555
02:07:50,172 --> 02:07:51,482
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, but...</font>

1556
02:07:51,602 --> 02:07:53,232
<font color="#ffff00">Kira wasn't the key.</font>

1557
02:07:54,242 --> 02:07:55,952
<font color="#ffff00">It was you, Mr. Morrow.</font>

1558
02:07:58,172 --> 02:07:59,882
<font color="#ffff00">You were the rose bud.</font>

1559
02:07:59,932 --> 02:08:02,452
<font color="#ffff00">And Halliday's
biggest regret was...</font>

1560
02:08:04,042 --> 02:08:05,952
<font color="#ffff00">losing his only friend.</font>

1561
02:08:10,082 --> 02:08:14,612
<font color="#ffff00">You know Jim used to say the OASIS was
never supposed to be a one player game.</font>

1562
02:08:18,402 --> 02:08:20,892
<font color="#ffff00">Now... Who do we have here?</font>

1563
02:08:22,142 --> 02:08:25,442
<font color="#ffff00">Look who it is.
It's my heroes, 'The High FIVE'.</font>

1564
02:08:25,452 --> 02:08:27,422
<font color="#ffff00">- You must be Art3mis?
- Samantha.</font>

1565
02:08:27,432 --> 02:08:29,102
<font color="#ffff00"><i>'The HIGH FIVE' took over the OASIS...</i></font>

1566
02:08:29,112 --> 02:08:30,618
<font color="#ffff00"><i>and the first thing we did was...</i></font>

1567
02:08:30,642 --> 02:08:34,182
<font color="#ffff00"><i>sign Ogden Morrow to a
non-exclusive consultancy.</i></font>

1568
02:08:34,292 --> 02:08:37,052
<font color="#ffff00"><i>The salary per his demand...</i></font>

1569
02:08:37,192 --> 02:08:40,652
<font color="#ffff00"><i>was 25 cents.
One quarter.</i></font>

1570
02:08:43,642 --> 02:08:45,842
<font color="#ffff00"><i>With his guidance, our
second move was to...</i></font>

1571
02:08:45,852 --> 02:08:49,112
<font color="#ffff00"><i>ban any Loyalty
Centers from accessing the OASIS.</i></font>

1572
02:08:49,472 --> 02:08:51,352
<font color="#ffff00"><i>IOI had no choice.</i></font>

1573
02:08:51,582 --> 02:08:53,242
<font color="#ffff00"><i>They shut 'em all down.</i></font>

1574
02:08:55,642 --> 02:08:58,252
<font color="#ffff00"><i>The third thing we did
wasn't as popular.</i></font>

1575
02:08:58,742 --> 02:09:02,192
<font color="#ffff00"><i>We close the OASIS on
Tuesdays and Thursdays.</i></font>

1576
02:09:02,552 --> 02:09:04,862
<font color="#ffff00"><i>I know it sounds like a weird move, but...</i></font>

1577
02:09:05,172 --> 02:09:08,192
<font color="#ffff00"><i>People need to spend more
time in the real world.</i></font>

1578
02:09:09,802 --> 02:09:12,552
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Because like Halliday said:</i></font>

1579
02:09:12,842 --> 02:09:16,082
<font color="#ffff00"><i>Reality is the only thing...</i></font>

1580
02:09:16,342 --> 02:09:17,782
<font color="#ffff00"><i>that's real.</i></font>

1581
02:09:18,642 --> 02:09:24,752
<font color="#ffff00">PREVIO by Parzival23.
Subtitled by CLARITY.</font>
